# PostHog analytics (src/analytics.ts): the Project API Key, shared with the
# other Lacuna Labs projects. Unset or empty: nothing is ever sent.
VITE_POSTHOG_KEY=
# Ingestion host override. Defaults to https://p.lacunalabs.it, which the
# app's Content-Security-Policy in index.html allows (script-src and
# connect-src); a different host must be added there too.
VITE_POSTHOG_HOST=
